Extensible text editor based on Vim, for writing code in the terminal

Neovim is a modern take on the Vim text editor. It keeps Vim's keyboard-driven editing and runs most Vim plugins, and adds an API so plugins and graphical front ends can be written in many languages.

- Compatible with most Vim plugins
- Built-in terminal emulator
- Asynchronous job control
- API access from many programming languages
- Works with a range of graphical front ends
